 - Fix build issues on some BSD derivatives (#2135).
 - Fix alignment of `caf::async::batch` on 32bit ARM architecture (#2142).
 - Timestamps in log output are now rendered without surrounding quotes (#2216).
+- Calling `quit` from a message handler of an actor shell, e.g., from the
+  default error handler after a request timed out, no longer triggers an
+  assertion. Previously, the actor shell kept reading from its mailbox after
+  closing it.
 
 ### Removed
 
